      "uid": "zhcn:19a7968a4f9339268bb76ab4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "集训期间，她每天都练得大汗淋漓又满身泥土。\n一心一意地努力，再努力……实在让人敬佩啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a610cd4232ba7f20dde21356a465f9c45d7973d8eb30a74cc962575e670781e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
