      "uid": "zhcn:6be100ebf730a5f975956fd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来一出道，她竟然参加了三场后冠赛事！\n很厉害吧，『樱花赏』『橡树大赛』『秋华赏』三场全都参加了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6cf9feba91aaec48e7ce9d41d13cbdbbe886fd9074123865a615f5b1972b0a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
